      "message": "Patchset 2 reworks the schema. It has no D-Bus object paths and no EID any more. A protected component is named by its board configuration and record and the SPDM daemon resolves the names, which I think is close to option 1 from Ender. An integrated RoT needs no Protected property, because its record sits in the configuration of its device.\n\nThe design with a full example is in https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/docs/+/97301\nIt also says why Ports are not used for this, under Alternatives Considered.",
